616 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 254 0 R
/E (On the 3rd of July 2023, the volunteers of NSS GEC Patan came together to havefun Guru Purnima, a widespread occasion that can pay tribute to our respected mentors.The festivities started out as all the volunteers amassed in front of the administrative block, filled with enthusiasm and appreciate. To honour the professors, the volunteers had been divided into groups to carry out the 'Tilak Ceremony' held in different departments. The volunteers took splendid pride in performing the ritual of doing 'Tilak' of every professor, symbolizing reverence and gratitude. Following this, in adherence to Indian way of life, the volunteers sought the blessings of every professor through the 'Charanasparsh' gesture, which entails touching their toes as a signal of respect and gratitude. The professors were deeply moved by the profound display of respect and appreciation, and they responded by imparting their heartfelt blessings and commending the volunteers for their dedication)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
