633 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 255 0 R
/E (On 22 nd August 2023, Entrepreneurship event was organized by NSS Volunteers in order to promote economic growth, and provides access to goods and services. As a part of these NSS GEC PATAN had collaborated with Entrepreneur Club of GEC PATAN and had organized an event on World Entrepreneur Day to improves the overallstandard of living. The Dr. S & S. S. Gandhi Government Engineering College, Surat had organized an event for encouraging the Student Startup policy by giving them the token of encouragement, and the whole event was streamed live on the youtube channel of Dr. S.& S.S. Gandhi College YouTube which was made live for all the institutes of India . The event speaker was Dr. Sanjay R. Joshi and the co speaker was Mr. Gopal Arya. And the main speaker was respected Mr. Kashmiri Laal. The NSS Volunteers had made wonderful arrangement with the help of projector to watch the live stream together with all the students and faculty. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
