659 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 256 0 R
/E (                 Indian Independence Day is a momentous occasion that commemorates the freedom of India from British rule. It is celebrated on August 15th every year with great enthusiasm and patriotism. The day is marked by flag hoisting ceremonies, cultural events, parades, and patriotic songs. It is a time for Indians to reflect on the sacrifices made by freedom fighters and to celebrate the spirit of unity and independence. Our NSS Volunteer , faculties and students of primary school of Katpur celebrated 77th Independence Day with great fervor and patriotism at Government Engineering College Patan on August 15, 2023, We Sang our National Anthem and our Principal sir gives brief introduction of the importance of Independence day. We also conduct a competition on Drawing and Elocution , our Student gave inspiring speeches in Hindi , Gujarati , and English. A cultural program was also held in our college where college student and students of primary school are participated some student performed a group patriotic song, some student performs group dance and some student played a drama as a part of the occasion.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [9]
>>
