/E (Under Swachhtaa hi Seva, On 1st November, 2023, NSS Volunteers and faculties took a vow to clean our surroundings. We started with cleaning our campus and on 2nd day of drive we decided to clean E.C. department. We went to the E.C Department we cleaned the department and professors also joined us in this drive. They cleaned their cabins and faculty office, classrooms and labs helping us to clean department. Volunteer joyfully cleaned the surrounding with the help of workers/cleaners and Faculties. Some of the students from department also joined us to clean surrounding. They were happy and inspired by NSS Team works. After cleaning the area, volunteers, Students and professors washed their hand properly and sanitized. Our Principal and H.O.D appreciated our work. After this H.O.D sir called all the students and volunteer present there in the department and gave the speech on importance of clean surrounding and nation and also asked us to clean & maintain it daily.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [11]
>>
